<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover" />
  <title>Support — Rizins Smash</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/theme.css?v=6" />
  <script src="/js/native-app.js?v=1"></script>
</head>
<body>
  <div style="max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1rem 3rem;">
    <div class="card" style="line-height: 1.6;">
      <h1 style="margin-top: 0;">Support</h1>
      <p>Rizins Smash is the staff app for Rizins Smash stores. Employees use it to book shifts, view rosters, submit timesheets and view payslips; managers use it to approve shifts, build rosters and run their stores.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Email <a href="mailto:<%= contactEmail %>"><%= contactEmail %></a> and we'll get back to you, usually within one business day.</p>

      <h2>Common questions</h2>
      <p><strong>How do I get an account?</strong><br>Accounts are created by your store manager. Ask them for your user ID and password.</p>
      <p><strong>I forgot my password.</strong><br>Ask your store manager to reset it, or email us.</p>
      <p><strong>I'm not getting notifications.</strong><br>On iPhone, open Settings → Notifications → Rizins Smash and make sure notifications are allowed.</p>
      <p><strong>How do I save a payslip or report?</strong><br>Tap the download button and choose "Save to Files" or another app from the share sheet.</p>

      <p style="margin-top: 2rem;"><a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> · <a href="/login">Log in</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
